<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>瘋人誣婦</title><title type="alternate">Feng ren wu fu [An Accusation, Family Testimony and Official Inquiry]</title><author>圖說未見署名，畫款另記</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.2.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.2.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>點石齋畫報</title><date when="1895">1895，御十第79圖</date><idno>L.sin. K 175-31/37 / bsb00075647, scan 381, 御十第79圖</idno><ref target="https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb00075647?page=381">巴伐利亞邦立圖書館</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="381" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v3/bsb00075647_00381/full/2600,/0/default.jpg" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="381" facs="#original-page" /><head>瘋人誣婦</head><p><lb n="right-1" />麋臺鹿苑之間有某明經焉<lb n="right-2" />鬱々家居致成心疾書空咄<lb n="right-3" />咄不減殷浩當年室人某氏<lb n="right-4" />賢慧性成居賤食貧絶無怨<lb n="right-5" />色一日明經忽至某署大堂<lb n="right-6" />擊鼓叫喊差役大驚奔告明<lb n="right-7" />府明府立出登堂見其滿身<lb n="right-8" />血污急詢有何奇寃答稱爲<lb n="right-9" />妻所毆將有性命之憂急迫<lb n="right-10" />至此明府見其情狀似若可<lb n="right-11" />信立飭差役往提其妻其妻<lb n="right-12" />茫無頭緒隨差到署據供丈<lb n="right-13" />夫素有瘋症此次實由渠自<lb n="right-14" />用花瓶擊破頭顱並非小婦<lb n="right-15" />人所毆明府覆問明經則目<lb n="right-16" />瞪口呆語無倫次未幾其</p><p><lb n="left-1" />姪某茂才亦至訴明伊瘋<lb n="left-2" />情形遂領歸焉兼聽則<lb n="left-3" />明偏聽則暗世有訊鞫<lb n="left-4" />之責者其可據一面之<lb n="left-5" />詞而漫加刑責哉</p><note type="artist-signature" n="圖右下畫款">志瀛</note><note type="artist-seal" n="畫款下一方印" /><note type="form-mark" n="原刊圖號">七十九</note><note type="form-mark" n="原刊期碼">御十</note><note type="printer-seal" n="圖說末一方橢圓印" /></div></body></text></TEI>